TI  - Training Intensity Distribution, Load Management, and Performance in Recreational Long-Distance Runners
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS PHYSIOLOGY AND PERFORMANCE
LA  - English
KW  - endurance training
KW  - training intensity zones
KW  - internal load monitoring
KW  - recreational runners
