TI  - Monitoring internal and external training load in male academy football players (<18 years): Methodological inconsistencies and practical implications
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS SCIENCE & COACHING
LA  - English
KW  - Athlete monitoring
