TI  - Training Load and Baseline Characteristics Associated With New Injury/Pain Within an Endurance Sporting Population: A Prospective Study
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS PHYSIOLOGY AND PERFORMANCE
LA  - English
