TI  - Endurance sport practice as a risk factor for atrial fibrillation and atrial flutter
T2  - EUROPACE
LA  - English
KW  - PHYSICAL-ACTIVITY
KW  - FOLLOW-UP
KW  - PREVALENCE
KW  - ABLATION
KW  - DISEASE
