TI  - Maintenance of internal load despite a stepwise reduction in external load during moderate intensity heart rate clamped cycling with acute graded normobaric hypoxia in males
T2  - JOURNAL OF SCIENCE AND MEDICINE IN SPORT
LA  - English
KW  - Endurance exercise
