TI  - THE BURDEN WITHIN - THE ENERGY-COST OF LOAD CARRIAGE IN THE HONEYPOT ANT, MYRMECOCYSTUS
T2  - PHYSIOLOGICAL ZOOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - RESPIRATORY METABOLISM
