TI  - Conversion from vagal to sympathetic predominance with strenuous training in high-performance world class athletes
T2  - CIRCULATION
LA  - English
KW  - exercise
KW  - nervous system, autonomic
KW  - reflex
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
