TI  - Prescribing submaximal training based on the lactate threshold improved aerobic fitness in dogs with preclinical myxomatous mitral valve disease
T2  - COMPARATIVE EXERCISE PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - incremental exercise test
KW  - heart failure
