TI  - Does transforming subjective measures of load better represent training and match-play intensity in youth soccer players?
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS SCIENCE & COACHING
LA  - English
KW  - Association football
KW  - athlete monitoring
KW  - rating of perceived exertion
KW  - running distance
