TI  - Intraocular pressure and ocular perfusion pressure responses during low-intensity endurance exercise in primary-open angle glaucoma patients versus age- and sex-matched controls: Influence of walking pace and external load
T2  - OPHTHALMIC AND PHYSIOLOGICAL OPTICS
LA  - English
