TI  - Agreement and reliability of magnetic, angular rate, and gravity (MARG) sensors to assess multiple body segment's external loads during off-road running
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE INSTITUTION OF MECHANICAL ENGINEERS PART P-JOURNAL OF SPORTS ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Technology
KW  - inertial measurement devices
