TI  - Association Between Global Positioning System- Based Training Load and Injury Risk in Recreational Runners: A Large Prospective Study
T2  - JOURNAL OF ATHLETIC TRAINING
LA  - English
KW  - running-related injury
KW  - injury prevention
KW  - run-ning
KW  - athletes
KW  - RUNNING-RELATED INJURIES
KW  - ETIOLOGY
