TI  - The relationship between training load and fitness indices over a pre-season in professional soccer players
T2  - JOURNAL OF SPORTS MEDICINE AND PHYSICAL FITNESS
LA  - English
KW  - Soccer
KW  - Athletes
KW  - Athletic performance
KW  - Physical fitness
KW  - AEROBIC-FITNESS
KW  - PHYSICAL-FITNESS
KW  - STRENGTH
KW  - PERFORMANCE
KW  - SEASON
KW  - FOOTBALL
