TI  - Identifying the ideal weekly training load for in-game performance in an elite Brazilian soccer team
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - soccer
KW  - fixture congestion
KW  - match demands
KW  - training
KW  - load
KW  - PHYSICAL PERFORMANCE
