TI  - Inertial Measurement Unit Use for Elite Women's Water Polo Upper Limb External Training Monitoring: An Observational Study
T2  - TRANSLATIONAL JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN COLLEGE OF SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
