TI  - Relation between Individualized Training Impulses and Performance in Distance Runners
T2  - MEDICINE AND SCIENCE IN SPORTS AND EXERCISE
LA  - English
KW  - TRAINING LOAD
KW  - HR. LACTATE THRESHOLD
KW  - ENDURANCE
KW  - EXERCISE INTENSITY
