TI  - High Intensity Interval Training in Handcycling: The Effects of a 7 Week Training Intervention in Able-bodied Men
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - upper body exercise
KW  - endurance training
KW  - handcycling
KW  - physiological capacity
KW  - SPINAL-CORD-INJURY
