TI  - Exploring training-sleep characteristics and bidirectional lagged relationships in Chinese recreational runners: insights from a year-long wearable monitoring study
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - recreational runners
KW  - season
KW  - sleep
KW  - training
