TI  - Differences in the Relative External Load Demands of Pre-Competitive Warm-Ups and Official Matches in Semi-Professional Football Players: A Pilot Study Considering Specific Positions
T2  - JOURNAL OF FUNCTIONAL MORPHOLOGY AND KINESIOLOGY
LA  - English
