TI  - The Importance of 'Durability' in the Physiological Profiling of Endurance Athletes
T2  - SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - MUSCLE METABOLIC-RESPONSES
KW  - CRITICAL POWER CONCEPT
KW  - MAXIMUM OXYGEN-UPTAKE
