TI  - THE DYNAMICS OF SPECIAL EFFICIENCY OF SPORTSMEN, WHO SPECIALIZE IN MIDDLE DISTANCE RUNNING
T2  - HEALTH PROBLEMS OF CIVILIZATION
LA  - English
KW  - heart rates
